OL,3,GNEWSABuilders told to halt housing
OL,4,Ascheme over 'breaches'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevelopers have been ordered to halt
OL,7,Fwork on a new housing development in
OL,8,FSapcote after council bosses said they
OL,9,Fbreached planning conditions.
OL,11,FBlaby District Council said it had
OL,12,Fissued a temporary stop notice to
OL,13,FWilliam Davis Homes requiring it to
OL,14,Fdown tools on an 80-home scheme, in
OL,15,FLeicester Road, for 56 days.
OL,17,FThe authority said the firm had started
OL,18,Fthe work before complying with several
OL,19,Fenvironmental conditions attached to
OL,20,Fthe planning permission.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
